{"availability":"available","full":"ArunNGun/Bench","name":"Bench","description":"Open source peptide, HGH and anabolic tracker. No account, no server, no analytics. Everything stays on your device.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2026-07-31T09:20:03Z","updated":"2026-10-05T20:55:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://benchpep.vercel.app/landing","topics":["android","health-tracker","nextjs","peptide","pwa","typescript"],"demo":"https://benchpep.vercel.app/landing","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:17:50.939Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T23:17:50.939Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T23:17:50.939Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:25.644Z","stars":8,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:17:50.939Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An open source tracker for peptide, growth hormone and anabolic protocols. Protocols, doses, stock, reconstitution, bloodwork and outcomes, with no account, no server and no analytics by default. Everything you enter stays in your browser, on your device.","If you want the same data on more than one device, you can point the app at a sync server you host yourself, in server/. It is off until you set it up, and what goes up is encrypted in your browser first, so the machine holding it cannot read it.","Runs as a web app, installs to a home screen as a PWA, and ships as an Android APK."],"features":["Reconstitution is exact and tested. A U-40 barrel and a U-100 barrel look similar and differ by 2.5×. The app never guesses which one you are holding, draws the syringe to the real proportions of the barrel you picked,…","Blends are decomposed. A blend is not one compound. Each component is modelled on its own half-life rather than collapsing into one averaged line, and exposure is compared weekly, because 500 mcg daily and 2.5 mg twice…","Every dose figure is tagged with its evidence. An approved label, a clinical trial and a forum convention are all shown, and never look alike.","Unknowns stay unknown. Where a half-life has never been measured in humans, as with trenbolone, boldenone and several research peptides, the app says so and draws no curve rather than inventing one that looks…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArunNGun/Bench/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9d68751226afb27822c5e7e00b140e58b0b1deef1159aba886f1d611601164dd","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:25.883Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:25.883Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open source tracker for peptide, growth hormone and anabolic protocols. Protocols, doses, stock, reconstitution, bloodwork and outcomes, with no account, no server and no analytics by default. Everything you enter stays in your browser, on your device.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArunNGun/Bench/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Protocols, doses, stock, reconstitution, bloodwork and outcomes, with no account, no server and no analytics by default.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArunNGun/Bench/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9d68751226afb27822c5e7e00b140e58b0b1deef1159aba886f1d611601164dd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArunNGun/Bench/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:25.883Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T20:55:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArunNGun/Bench/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:25.883Z","hash":"9d68751226afb27822c5e7e00b140e58b0b1deef1159aba886f1d611601164dd","originalBytes":13795,"storedBytes":13795,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["app","server","android","data","never","npm","what","read","one","run","src","build","does","dose","rather","compounds","import","lib","sync","browser","it.","library","nothing","source","they","which","cannot","device","every","first","key","new","open","reconstitution